    "title": "When to expect your Social Security payment for April. See schedule.",
    "text": "March 30, 2026, 6:03 a.m. ETSocial Security payments in April will follow a normal schedule, with the first payments hitting on April 8.Social Security benefits – paid mostly to recipients who are older or retired – are typically scheduled to go out on Wednesdays. On the second Wednesday of the month, payments are issued for beneficiaries whose birthdays fall between the first and 10th days of the month (for April, that is April 8), according to the Social Security Administration’s calendar.Recipients born between the 11th and 20th get paid on the third Wednesday (April 15) of the month; those born after the 20th of the month are paid on the fourth Wednesday of the month (April 22), according to the SSA calendar. Social Security recipients who began getting benefits before May 1997 are scheduled to be paid on Friday, April 3.Here's the schedule for Social Security payments in April.Social Security payment schedule for April 2026The Social Security Administration’s benefit payments calendar for 2026 and 2027 is available online – and there's a handy calendar below – so you can check the schedules for budgeting purposes.April 2026 Social Security retirement benefits will be sent out on the SSA’s usual schedule:Wednesday, April 8: Birth dates between the first and 10th of the month.Wednesday, April 15: Birth dates between the 11th and 20th of the month.Wednesday, April 22: Birth dates between the 21st and 31st of the month.SSI payment schedule for April and the rest of 2026Supplemental Security Income (SSI) is a program benefitting those with limited or no income or resources, those aged 65 or older, and those who are blind or have a qualifying disability. Children with a qualifying disability are also eligible for SSI, according to the SSA website.SSI recipients are typically issued payments on the first business day of the month – in April, that is Wednesday, April 1. Here are the dates for SSI payments for 2026, according to the SSA calendar:Wednesday, April 1, 2026 (Check for April 2026)Friday, May 1, 2026 (Check for May 2026)Monday, June 1, 2026 (Check for June 2026)Wednesday, July 1, 2026 (Check for July 2026)Friday, July 31, 2026 (Check for August 2026)Tuesday, Sept. 1, 2026 (Check for September 2026)Thursday, Oct. 1, 2026 (Check for October 2026)Friday, Oct. 30, 2026 (Check for November 2026)Tuesday, Dec. 1, 2026 (Check for December 2026)Thursday, Dec. 31, 2026 (Check for January 2027)Here's a calendar showing all the Social Security and SSI payments for 2026.Social Security payment schedule 2026Mike Snider is a national trending news reporter for USA TODAY. You can follow him on Threads, Bluesky, X and email him at mikegsnider & @mikegsnider.bsky.social & @mikesnider & msnider@usatoday.com.",
